{"id":"c00819421d97c693","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/716_ALU.md","title":"716 ALU","display":"716_ALU","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"716-ALU\">716 ALU</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R)\">\\(\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_C\">\\(N_C\\)</span> 为概念名集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_R\">\\(N_R\\)</span> 为角色名集合，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_C\\cap N_R=\\varnothing\">\\(N_C\\cap N_R=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>ALU 的概念构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{atomneg},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{existsTop}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{atomneg},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{existsTop}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{atomneg}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{atomneg}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{forall}:\nN_R\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{existsTop}:N_R\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{forall}:\nN_R\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{existsTop}:N_R\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top,\\bot,\\neg A,C\\sqcap D,C\\sqcup D,\\forall R.C,\\exists R.\\top\">\\(\\top,\\bot,\\neg A,C\\sqcap D,C\\sqcup D,\\forall R.C,\\exists R.\\top\\)</span>。其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\">\\(\\neg A\\)</span> 只允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in N_C\">\\(A\\in N_C\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-概念表达式\">2. 概念表达式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\)</span> 为满足下列形成条款的最小集合。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\">\\(\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in N_C\">\\(A\\in N_C\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\">\\(\\operatorname{name}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in N_C\">\\(A\\in N_C\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atomneg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\">\\(\\operatorname{atomneg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\">\\(C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conj}(C,D)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\">\\(\\operatorname{conj}(C,D)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\">\\(C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{disj}(C,D)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\">\\(\\operatorname{disj}(C,D)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{forall}(R,C)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\">\\(\\operatorname{forall}(R,C)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{existsTop}(R)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\">\\(\\operatorname{existsTop}(R)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-包含式与-TBox\">3. 包含式与 TBox</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\n=\n\\{(C,D):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\n=\n\\{(C,D):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,D)\">\\((C,D)\\)</span> 显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\sqsubseteq D\">\\(C\\sqsubseteq D\\)</span>。TBox 载体为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TBox}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\n=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TBox}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\n=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-自由名字与替换\">4. 自由名字与替换</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\to\\mathcal P(N_C\\cup N_R)\">\\(\\operatorname{FN}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\to\\mathcal P(N_C\\cup N_R)\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\operatorname{FN}(\\neg A)=\\{A\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\operatorname{FN}(\\neg A)=\\{A\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\forall R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\forall R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\exists R.\\top)=\\{R\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\exists R.\\top)=\\{R\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义无绑定名字函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}(C)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}(C)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个名字排序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\{N_C,N_R\\}\">\\(S\\in\\{N_C,N_R\\}\\)</span> 固定无重复枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^S_0,e^S_1,\\ldots\">\\(e^S_0,e^S_1,\\ldots\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq S\">\\(X\\subseteq S\\)</span> 有限，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}(S,X)=e^S_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{k:e^S_k\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}(S,X)=e^S_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{k:e^S_k\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_C:N_C\\to N_C\">\\(\\theta_C:N_C\\to N_C\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_R:N_R\\to N_R\">\\(\\theta_R:N_R\\to N_R\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}(\\top)=\\top,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Ren}(\\bot)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}(\\top)=\\top,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Ren}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\operatorname{name}(\\theta_C(A)),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Ren}(\\neg A)=\\neg\\theta_C(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\operatorname{name}(\\theta_C(A)),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Ren}(\\neg A)=\\neg\\theta_C(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{Ren}(C)\\sqcap\\operatorname{Ren}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{Ren}(C)\\sqcap\\operatorname{Ren}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{Ren}(C)\\sqcup\\operatorname{Ren}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{Ren}(C)\\sqcup\\operatorname{Ren}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}(\\forall R.C)=\\forall\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Ren}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}(\\forall R.C)=\\forall\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Ren}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}(\\exists R.\\top)=\\exists\\theta_R(R).\\top.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}(\\exists R.\\top)=\\exists\\theta_R(R).\\top.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALU}}\n=\n\\{(C,C):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALU}}\n=\n\\{(C,C):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall R.C\">\\(\\forall R.C\\)</span> 是角色限制构造子，不绑定概念名或角色名；捕获避免重命名就是保持排序的有限支撑替换，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\)</span> 只用于选择未出现在有限名字集中的新名字。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{refl}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\top}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E1}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E2}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcup I1}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcup I2}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{atomneg}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{refl}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\top}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E1}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E2}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcup I1}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcup I2}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{atomneg}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)=\\mathcal T,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)=\\mathcal T,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{refl}}=\\{C\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{refl}}=\\{C\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\top}=\\{C\\sqsubseteq\\top:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}=\\{\\bot\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\top}=\\{C\\sqsubseteq\\top:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}=\\{\\bot\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E1}=\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E1}=\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E2}=\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E2}=\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcup I1}=\\{C\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcup I1}=\\{C\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcup I2}=\\{D\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcup I2}=\\{D\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{atomneg}}=\\{A\\sqcap\\neg A\\sqsubseteq\\bot:A\\in N_C\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{atomneg}}=\\{A\\sqcap\\neg A\\sqsubseteq\\bot:A\\in N_C\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>传递：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n=\\{(((C,D),(D,E)),(C,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n=\\{(((C,D),(D,E)),(C,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>合取引入：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n=\\{(((C,D),(C,E)),(C,D\\sqcap E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n=\\{(((C,D),(C,E)),(C,D\\sqcap E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>析取消去：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\n=\\{(((C,E),(D,E)),(C\\sqcup D,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\n=\\{(((C,E),(D,E)),(C\\sqcup D,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>全称单调：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\forall R.C,\\forall R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\forall R.C,\\forall R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>底规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n=\\{(((C,\\bot)),(C,D)):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n=\\{(((C,\\bot)),(C,D)):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 出发的 ALU 证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\)</span>，且每行满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}(\\mathcal T)\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}(\\mathcal T)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义证明谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 是满足上述六类行条件且末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,D)\">\\((C,D)\\)</span> 的非空有限序列。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可导出关系\">8. 可导出关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALU}}C\\sqsubseteq D\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALU}}C\\sqsubseteq D\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-语义结构与解释\">9. 语义结构与解释</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\)</span> 由所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I=(\\Delta,\\iota_C,\\iota_R)\">\\(\\mathcal I=(\\Delta,\\iota_C,\\iota_R)\\)</span> 组成，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_C:N_C\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\">\\(\\iota_C:N_C\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_R:N_R\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta)\">\\(\\iota_R:N_R\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta)\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\top\\rrbracket=\\Delta,\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket=\\iota_C(A),\\quad\n\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket=\\Delta\\setminus\\iota_C(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\top\\rrbracket=\\Delta,\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket=\\iota_C(A),\\quad\n\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket=\\Delta\\setminus\\iota_C(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket C\\sqcap D\\rrbracket=\\llbracket C\\rrbracket\\cap\\llbracket D\\rrbracket,\\quad\n\\llbracket C\\sqcup D\\rrbracket=\\llbracket C\\rrbracket\\cup\\llbracket D\\rrbracket,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket C\\sqcap D\\rrbracket=\\llbracket C\\rrbracket\\cap\\llbracket D\\rrbracket,\\quad\n\\llbracket C\\sqcup D\\rrbracket=\\llbracket C\\rrbracket\\cup\\llbracket D\\rrbracket,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\forall R.C\\rrbracket=\n\\{x:\\forall y((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\Rightarrow y\\in\\llbracket C\\rrbracket)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\forall R.C\\rrbracket=\n\\{x:\\forall y((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\Rightarrow y\\in\\llbracket C\\rrbracket)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\exists R.\\top\\rrbracket=\\{x:\\exists y\\ (x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\exists R.\\top\\rrbracket=\\{x:\\exists y\\ (x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-满足关系与语义后承\">10. 满足关系与语义后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALU}}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\llbracket C\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\subseteq\n\\llbracket D\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALU}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALU}}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\llbracket C\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\subseteq\n\\llbracket D\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALU}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALU}}I\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal K=(\\mathcal T,\\varnothing,\\varnothing)\\land I\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\n((\\forall J\\in\\mathcal T\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALU}}J)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALU}}I).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALU}}I\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal K=(\\mathcal T,\\varnothing,\\varnothing)\\land I\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\n((\\forall J\\in\\mathcal T\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALU}}J)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALU}}I).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-特征差异\">11. 特征差异</h1>\n<p>ALU 的目标差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{or}\\},\n\\{\\operatorname{exists},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{atLeast},\\operatorname{atMost},\\operatorname{roleHierarchy}\\}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{or}\\},\n\\{\\operatorname{exists},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{atLeast},\\operatorname{atMost},\\operatorname{roleHierarchy}\\}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第一分量要求第 2 节的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\sqcup D\">\\(C\\sqcup D\\)</span> 构造子、析取左右引入公理和析取消去规则同时出现；因此 ALU 不是 AL 的改名。</p>\n<h1 id=\"12.-整个形式系统\">12. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\n=\n(N_C,N_R,\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\n\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\n\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALU}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket^{\\mathsf{ALU}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALU}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{ALU}}\n=\n(N_C,N_R,\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\n\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\n\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALU}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket^{\\mathsf{ALU}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{ALU}},\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALU}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统不含完整存在限制、任意概念否定、数目限制、角色层级或外部模型类名称。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"716-ALU","text":"716 ALU","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-概念表达式","text":"2. 概念表达式","level":1},{"id":"3.-包含式与-TBox","text":"3. 包含式与 TBox","level":1},{"id":"4.-自由名字与替换","text":"4. 自由名字与替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则","text":"6. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导出关系","text":"8. 可导出关系","level":1},{"id":"9.-语义结构与解释","text":"9. 语义结构与解释","level":1},{"id":"10.-满足关系与语义后承","text":"10. 满足关系与语义后承","level":1},{"id":"11.-特征差异","text":"11. 特征差异","level":1},{"id":"12.-整个形式系统","text":"12. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R)","display":false},{"tex":"N_C","display":false},{"tex":"N_R","display":false},{"tex":"N_C\\cap N_R=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\op